WEBVTT

00:01:38.070 --> 00:01:49.830
Lord Joshua?

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:52.590
Lord Josh...

00:01:59.180 --> 00:02:00.390
Lord Joshua!

00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:03.390
Big sister?

00:02:04.470 --> 00:02:06.600
The noise is horrible.

00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:09.350
If I don't drown it out like this,then...

00:02:09.350 --> 00:02:13.110
There is nothing to worry about.

00:02:13.110 --> 00:02:15.530
Now, let's get you back to bed.

00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:21.280
If you stay like this,
you will catch a cold, so...

00:02:22.320 --> 00:02:23.660
Don't stop it!

00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:31.960
Again...

00:02:33.460 --> 00:02:37.720
Again... The noise is awful again!

00:02:49.230 --> 00:02:51.980
So it's no good unless it's
his real sister after all, is it?

00:02:53.860 --> 00:02:57.150
Lady Rizel has already gone to get her.

00:02:57.150 --> 00:02:58.190
Rizel has?

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:02.990
Unseemly... That is what she said.

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:36.110
Rosette?

00:03:36.980 --> 00:03:38.820
I'm sorry, did I wake you?

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:41.200
No. Can't sleep?

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:45.990
Kind of.
I'm not very good at staying still.

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:48.870
You can't relax unless
you're destroying something, right?

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:52.750
What do you think I am?

00:03:52.750 --> 00:03:56.380
Right, right, this is how
you need to be, Rosette.

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:13.940
I wonder how Rosette and
the others are doing about now?

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:19.900
Sister Kate, do you
think that Azmaria is all right?

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:22.950
What if she gets attacked
by monsters or something?!

00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:26.450
What are you talking about?!
Rosette and Chrono are with her!

00:04:28.280 --> 00:04:29.620
This is true.

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:34.580
Let us pray for them for now,

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:40.130
for they have gathered
their courage and gone to face destiny.

00:04:46.640 --> 00:04:48.050
What's come over you?

00:04:48.050 --> 00:04:50.470
You've had a happy look
on your face for a while now.

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:52.220
Did you have a good dream or something?

00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:56.400
No, when I woke up, you were both here,

00:04:56.400 --> 00:05:00.480
and so I started to feel really happy.

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:06.820
When I thought that this
isn't a dream, somehow...

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:11.700
I kind of feel like I'm
putting you in danger, Azmaria.

00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:14.500
And I wonder if this
really is for the best or not.

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:19.170
That isn't the case at all!
This is what I wanted!

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:21.250
And besides, if I'm around,

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:23.960
it will cut down on the amount
of work it will take to find the Sinners.

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:28.180
Az, you've gotten stronger, haven't you?

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:32.260
Oof...

00:05:34.850 --> 00:05:39.400
Oh, my, it's crowded
here too. What a bother...

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:41.150
Mama...

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:43.530
If you'd like, then please sit over here.

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:47.740
My, I'm sorry, Sister. Is it really all right?

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:51.580
Yes, we'll take turns sitting.

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:52.910
Chrono, the luggage.

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:54.160
Right.

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:56.710
Thank you very much.

00:05:56.710 --> 00:05:59.420
Now, Jimmy, you thank them too.

00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:01.420
Thank you, big brother.

00:06:01.420 --> 00:06:02.880
You're welco...

00:06:11.640 --> 00:06:13.560
Excuse me, would you
please get out of the way?

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:15.520
Satella?!

00:06:15.520 --> 00:06:20.020
Truly, those of the Magdalene Order have
no sense of how to behave in public society.

00:06:21.900 --> 00:06:23.320
Hey, hey!

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:25.030
Why are you here?!

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:29.030
Work. I've been called to the West Coast.

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:33.870
In any case, what <i>is</i> this? A freight car?

00:06:39.920 --> 00:06:44.880
Now, now, Jimmy, you and
your Mama, please, go inside.

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:48.420
It seems that a certain rich lady who
doesn't know how to behave in public society

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:51.760
has rented an entire car,
so there's no need to worry about it.

00:06:52.470 --> 00:06:53.760
But Sister...

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:55.810
There's no need to hold back.

00:06:55.810 --> 00:06:59.230
After all, with this many rooms, there's
no way she would be able to use them all.

00:06:59.230 --> 00:07:01.270
Isn't that right, Princess?

00:07:01.270 --> 00:07:02.940
Do as you wish.

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:06.940
I was certain a train was
something you rented the entirety of.

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:10.030
Woman, you are just so infuriating!

00:07:11.490 --> 00:07:14.830
Sister? This isn't exactly in thanks,

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:18.200
but please eat this with everyone else.

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:20.120
Thank you very much!

00:07:20.790 --> 00:07:26.840
Seriously, the way you flip-flop because
of food has to be some kind of talent.

00:07:26.840 --> 00:07:30.420
Nyah! I'm definitely
not going to give you any!

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:32.430
Oh, they're muffins!

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:54.110
Hey...

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:58.660
It wouldn't be right for us to
eat this by ourselves, you know?

00:07:58.660 --> 00:08:01.330
So maybe I'll go and give Jimmy one.

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:07.170
You know, snacks taste better
when everyone shares after all.

00:08:07.170 --> 00:08:09.960
I'm going to go back for
a little bit one more time, okay?

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:11.340
Rosette!

00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:18.890
Jimmy! Who in the world are you two?!

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:42.080
Who are you?!
Why do you have a picture of Joshua?!

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:44.040
Now, calm down,

00:08:44.870 --> 00:08:46.500
Sister Rosette.

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:50.250
Welcome! Good of you to come.

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:52.920
We have been waiting for you to arrive.

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:00.890
You're the one from before.

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:04.810
It's been a long time, Sister Rosette.

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:07.400
I have come for you once again.

00:09:10.520 --> 00:09:12.030
Azmaria!

00:09:12.030 --> 00:09:15.650
Oh my, again?
You do fall down a lot, don't you?

00:09:15.650 --> 00:09:17.530
I'm sorry.

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:20.660
I'm just worried about Rosette.

00:09:22.450 --> 00:09:25.460
She probably just stopped
by the dining car or something.

00:09:25.460 --> 00:09:27.920
That girl eats like a horse after all.

00:09:32.210 --> 00:09:35.920
I know all about your
perversions. What do you want?

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:39.850
Now, no need to rush.
Let's be friendly about this.

00:09:40.800 --> 00:09:43.220
As if I would want to be friendly with you!

00:09:43.220 --> 00:09:47.270
Do you not want to see Lord Joshua?

00:09:47.270 --> 00:09:50.360
Joshua... He's all right, isn't he?

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:56.700
Yes, he's well. So well that
he says the noise is bothersome.

00:09:56.700 --> 00:10:00.660
Noise? Is he in pain?!

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:03.120
He is screaming in pain.

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:06.460
If only he would just go away...

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:08.580
Seriously...

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:14.000
Why Lord Aion fixated on that one, I...

00:10:19.970 --> 00:10:21.050
Now, then.

00:10:21.970 --> 00:10:24.310
Let us go on a new journey.

00:10:31.480 --> 00:10:35.440
I'm afraid that with what
just happened, we're leaving your friends.

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:42.070
After all, it would be inexcusable for me
to bring Chrono back before Lord Aion.

00:10:42.070 --> 00:10:44.580
Even now, your precious Lord Joshua

00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:48.330
is calling for you from
the depths of his suffering.

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:51.750
See him, and comfort him...

00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:56.760
Or if you are so inclined, why not end his
suffering with your gun, that one right there?

00:11:01.890 --> 00:11:05.810
Stop the train right now,
and release the passengers here!

00:11:05.810 --> 00:11:07.140
Hurry up!

00:11:11.060 --> 00:11:15.230
Sister, please, forgive me!

00:11:17.900 --> 00:11:19.950
Are you going to shoot that woman?

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:23.530
Shoot an innocent, pitiful marionette?

00:11:23.530 --> 00:11:26.870
That woman is just a human.

00:11:26.870 --> 00:11:27.830
Jimmy...

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:39.210
That's the face I wanted to see!

00:11:39.210 --> 00:11:41.170
What can you do?!

00:11:42.300 --> 00:11:47.350
What shall we do next for fun,
older sister of that annoying boy?

00:11:58.780 --> 00:11:59.780
A barrier?!

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:04.110
Chrono!

00:12:05.740 --> 00:12:08.540
You were babbling strangely earlier, right?

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:11.710
You really are bad at lying, Rosette.

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:15.710
Thank you, Chrono.

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:18.340
Rosette! The pocket watch!

00:12:21.420 --> 00:12:23.630
So now you realize it, do you?

00:12:23.630 --> 00:12:27.640
I've picked up something very nice.

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:37.310
Satella! Azmaria!

00:12:37.310 --> 00:12:42.940
I'm sorry. Satella protected me...

00:12:42.940 --> 00:12:44.240
Rizel!

00:12:46.870 --> 00:12:51.370
How many times do I have
to tell you? These are humans.

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:53.830
If you want to shoot so badly...

00:12:53.830 --> 00:12:55.500
Stand over there!

00:12:58.790 --> 00:12:59.920
Don't move!

00:13:01.630 --> 00:13:02.630
Stop it!

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:06.680
Rosette, let's do as they say.

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:18.980
Shoot him.

00:13:20.820 --> 00:13:22.030
Rosette!

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:30.490
Hurry up and fire, Sister Rosette.

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:35.500
What are you doing? Shoot me, Rosette!

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:37.290
You can't! Chrono!

00:13:38.380 --> 00:13:41.380
Listen, right here.

00:13:41.380 --> 00:13:43.380
Don't miss the center.

00:13:47.680 --> 00:13:48.760
Rosette!

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:50.350
Don't, Rosette!

00:13:50.350 --> 00:13:51.300
Az!

00:13:52.220 --> 00:13:56.730
Please, Azmaria, pray for Chrono!

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:15.330
Take that!

00:14:26.920 --> 00:14:28.010
Chrono!

00:14:32.350 --> 00:14:33.470
Chrono...

00:14:45.820 --> 00:14:48.400
Until we get back, everyone,

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:50.910
please don't leave this car, no matter what!

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:54.740
Satella, don't get knocked
unconscious this time, okay?

00:14:54.740 --> 00:14:56.410
What did you say?!

00:14:56.410 --> 00:14:59.410
Yes, yes, yes, that's enough, you two.

00:15:03.670 --> 00:15:06.420
Here we go. Be careful.

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:23.560
There!

00:15:31.070 --> 00:15:32.530
Rosette!

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:42.250
So we finally meet, older sister.

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:47.750
It's kind of unexpected, but as long as
I take you back with me, it'll be all right.

00:15:49.970 --> 00:15:51.050
Chrono!

00:15:53.010 --> 00:15:55.640
And with this,
the nuisances have disappeared.

00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:58.140
Shall we go on
a journey, just the two of us?

00:15:58.140 --> 00:16:01.730
If we're going to, then let
the engineer that you have hostage go!

00:16:02.730 --> 00:16:06.770
What are you talking about?
There aren't any hostages on this train.

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:10.240
I ate the mall.

00:16:15.780 --> 00:16:17.160
Why, you!

00:16:29.670 --> 00:16:35.890
I have you in the palm of my hand.
Come quietly with me to Lord Aion.

00:16:43.940 --> 00:16:46.650
What can you do all by your lonesome?

00:16:46.650 --> 00:16:48.150
I'm not alone.

00:16:49.400 --> 00:16:52.070
I'm sure that Chrono is all right.

00:16:52.070 --> 00:16:54.200
It's always been like that.

00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:56.740
Even when we're apart, I know!

00:16:56.740 --> 00:17:00.040
After all of this,
you're still trying to act tough?

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:04.370
I'm just telling the truth. I believe in him.

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:07.040
You're the one that's alone!

00:17:19.430 --> 00:17:21.680
That's quite a nice look.

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:26.020
It's too bad we can't
show it to your friends.

00:17:28.230 --> 00:17:32.110
Didn't I tell you that no matter
how many times you do it, it's useless?

00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:36.530
Out of bullets?

00:17:38.070 --> 00:17:39.450
Such perfect timing.

00:17:39.450 --> 00:17:44.370
If I don't end it here,
I'll probably be scolded by Lord Aion.

00:17:44.370 --> 00:17:46.410
You keep saying Aion, Aion,

00:17:46.410 --> 00:17:48.210
but you don't know anything, do you?

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:56.420
He considers Joshua to be necessary,
but he doesn't even take notice of you.

00:17:56.420 --> 00:17:59.890
That's why you're so
desperate to try and bring me back.

00:17:59.890 --> 00:18:02.310
Don't talk like you know anything.

00:18:02.310 --> 00:18:07.230
You poor woman.
Even Aion doesn't love you.

00:18:07.230 --> 00:18:08.270
Shut up.

00:18:08.270 --> 00:18:09.480
I won't!

00:18:12.770 --> 00:18:14.650
You're not loved!

00:18:14.650 --> 00:18:15.610
Shut up!

00:18:15.610 --> 00:18:18.490
It's tough, isn't it? Painful, isn't it?

00:18:18.490 --> 00:18:19.240
Shut up!

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:21.240
No matter how much you love him,

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:24.120
he won't even notice you.

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:27.580
I'm sure that even God would
take pity on such a poor person.

00:18:27.580 --> 00:18:29.370
Shut up, damn you!

00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:31.790
I'll pray for your sake!

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:36.050
Lord, save this woman who is
mad from her unrequited love!

00:18:36.050 --> 00:18:37.800
Damn you!

00:18:53.610 --> 00:18:56.070
Go up! <i>Tief huschen!</i>

00:19:01.950 --> 00:19:02.950
Chrono!

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:13.670
I'll kill you!

00:19:13.670 --> 00:19:17.460
I'll kill you! I'll kill you!

00:19:48.750 --> 00:19:52.460
Lord...Aion...

00:20:52.890 --> 00:20:54.060
Rizel...

00:20:55.270 --> 00:20:57.110
It all came to nothing.
